SUMMARY:Autumn Witch Day Retreat
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n[Get Your Tickets Here](https://www.event
 brite.com/e/witchy-ways-day-retreat-tickets-1996341264462)\n\n**Calling in
  all healers\, plant parents\, mothers\, artists\, mystics\, rebels\, and 
 seekers.**\nThis day is an invitation to remember and return to all that y
 ou are.\n\nTogether\, we’ll spend an autumn afternoon slowing down\, dro
 pping in\, and reconnecting with ourselves\, the season\, and one another 
 through ritual\, reflection\, movement\, and a little witchcraft.\n\nAs we
  move through the energies of fall\, we’ll explore the seasonal invitati
 on to both release what has run its course and intentionally call in what 
 we’re ready to cultivate next.\n\n**Flow of the Day**\n*We’ll begin by
  gathering in opening circle\, setting our intentions\, calling in the dir
 ections\, and grounding into the space through a guided meditation and ene
 rgetic release.*\n\n*From there\, we’ll move into a ceremonial teaching 
 and transmission\, exploring the astrological energies of Libra\, Scorpio\
 , and Sagittarius alongside sacred feminine archetypes that can support us
  through the shifting season. Guided journaling\, shadow reflection\, and 
 group sharing will offer space to bring these teachings into your own live
 d experience.*\n\n*After a nourishing snack break\, we’ll return to the 
 body through intentional yoga and movement\, creating space for integratio
 n and embodiment.*\n\n*We’ll close our time together with a seasonal rit
 ual. A little autumn witchcraft devoted to releasing what you’re ready t
 o leave behind and calling in what you desire to cultivate. Through apple 
 magic\, fire\, candlelight\, and intention\, you’ll create a ritual piec
 e to take home and continue tending throughout the season.*\n\n*Our gather
 ing will conclude with a closing prayer and circle\, sealing the magic of 
 the day and honoring what has shifted\, opened\, or been remembered. Snack
 s and tea will be served.*\n\n**About your guides**\n**Jenn (She/Her)** is
  an intuitive healer trained Yoga Teacher 9+ years\, Reiki Master\, Astrol
 oger and Spiritual Coach. She combines her knowledge of the body from 13 y
 ears working in physical therapy with all spiritual tools that have contri
 buted to her own healing & spiritual journey to help guide others.\n**Vi (
 They/Them)** is a practicing Witch & Psychic who is a trained Yoga Teacher
 \, Reiki Master\, and Tarot Reader. They combine their passions of astrolo
 gy\, divination\, dance\, and creative expression to help others listen to
  their intuition.\n**Alessandra Mary (she/her)** is a ceremonialist\, Akas
 hic priestess\, mystic\, author\, and sacred storyteller devoted to the pa
 th of remembrance. Through sacred gatherings and oracular transmissions\, 
 she weaves soulful experiences that invite you into deeper connection with
  synchronicity\, authenticity\, and the unseen magic woven through everyda
 y life. She stewards the land we will be gathering on.\n\n**PLEASE NOTE: P
 re-registration is required for this event to honor the capacity of the sp
 ace.** If you would like to skip the fees\, you can Venmo us $60 [here](ht
 tps://venmo.com/u/iamalessandramary "https://venmo.com/u/iamalessandramary
 ")
