SUMMARY:Shamanic Full Moon Ceremony
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n**Join us beneath the Harvest Moon for an
  afternoon of reflection\, release\, and renewal.**\n\n**The Full Moon ill
 uminates what is ready to be seen. Together\, we will create sacred space 
 through grounding\, gratitude\, gentle shamanic practice\, and shared inte
 ntion. We will honor what has come to fruition\, release what we have outg
 rown\, and make room for the strength and wisdom waiting to emerge.**\n\n*
 *Come with an open heart\, a personal intention\, or simply curiosity. Arr
 ive as you are—there is nothing you need to prove and nothing you need t
 o fix.**\n\n**Together\, we will release\, reclaim\, and renew.**\n\n**Bri
 ng appropriate crystals that you would like charged. The best crystals to 
 charge during a full moon are amethyst\, smoky quartz\, citrine\, black se
 lenite\, and obsidian. We will be outside so please dress for the weather.
 **\n\n**Plenty of parking available\, you will need a gate code coming in 
 the community. Also cell phone service is spotty.**\n\n**This is a laid-ba
 ck event at our home\, I hope that you can join us.**\n\n**See you then!**
 \n**Shaman Phil**
