SUMMARY:Voice Love Night!
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n**Does your Voice long to express** for t
 he sake of truth\, art\, beauty\, majesty\, divination\, personal & commun
 ity healing\, energy transmutation\, FUN\, Love\, gift-giving\, or just be
 cause you really f@&king want to?\n\nDo you have a **song** in your heart\
 , a series of **silly jokes** in your throat\, feel a nudge to do a **live
  psychic reading**\, or got an idea for a random multi-modal **performance
  art** piece\, and want a safe space to explore\, share\, and hone your se
 lf-expression gifts?\n\nAre you \\~ or do you wish to be \\~ a unique-to-y
 ou singer\, speaker\, performer\, healer\, or divine messenger?\n\n**COME 
 TO VOICE LOVE NIGHT @ The Well** to nurture and inspire your voice\, try o
 ut your callings\, be held in community\, and receive the most loving and 
 helpful support & mentorship towards expressing more freely & fully — fo
 r your own soul fulfillment and the benefit of All!\n\nEvery first Thursda
 y of the month\, Devora of Voice Empowerment Arts LLC\, will host a unique
  evening combining playful & sacred **guided transformational voicework** 
 experiences along with an open stage to share your self-expression art wit
 h active support and feedback.\n\nVoicework experiences vary based on the 
 energy and needs of the room\, but generally work to open up your voice\, 
 ears\, & channels\; support somatic & emotional release\, activate healing
  & empowerment\; and expand your sense of safety & freedom to express.\n\n
 We got an acoustic piano\, a guitar and ukulele\, a projector for lyrics a
 nd other visuals\, a sound system\, and most importantly a private\, sacre
 d\, contained space to make whatever sounds & expressions you want to try 
 out.\n\n**PLEASE BRING** your instruments and any other tools or materials
  you may need!\n\n**DATE & TIME:** Every First Thursday of the month\, 7
 –9 pm\n*No event in December 2026.*\n\n**CONTRIBUTION:** Contribute your
  choice! — $11\, $22\, or $33. \\*No one turned away for lack of funds.\
 n\n**Registration required:** https://www.devorakalma.com/voice-love-night
 \n\nmore info on Devora & sacred therapeutic voicework here: devorakalma.c
 om\n\nfeel free to give me a shout if you have questions or curiosities\, 
 or just want to share more about your story:)
